Chromium 158.0.8127.37 -> 158.0.8127.62, for the 158.0.8127.37 tarball.

158.0.8127.62 is a tag on the 158 branch (refs/branch-heads/8127@{#1756}) that
has no source tarball (as of 2026-11-14). It adds 64 branch commits to
158.0.8127.37 (#1692), 52 of them not PGO/orderfile/AFDO rolls, translation
updates or VERSION increments: security fixes (PDFium page unloading, extension
script injection, DBSC session deletion, the P2P socket manager (two), scroll
timeline snapshots, FedCM (four), ChromePluginServiceFilter's RenderProcessHost
handling, Blink's AtomicString attribute references and HTMLPlugInElement image
loads, MediaPermissionDispatcher, and in the "Roll commits from side projects":
ANGLE's GL texture and Vulkan render pass, image view and SPIR-V varyings fixes
(two GL ones reverted again upstream), Dawn's wire buffer mapping, OpenGL snorm
and shared texture and WGSL minBindingSize fixes, Skia's Vulkan fence wait,
displacement filter and mask-filtered getImage, V8's Number.prototype.toString
radix, deoptimizer, InvokeApiFunction, phi lowering, RegionAllocator and three
sandbox fixes, PDFium's AlertIfPossible), DCSI's WrappedSkImageBacking, glic
(three), GPU raster SLQ, Device Sync field trials.

